WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.300
All right, now comes the exciting part.

2
00:00:02.560 --> 00:00:04.520
All right, so by the power vested in me

3
00:00:04.520 --> 00:00:06.900
as the minister of the gospel
of Jesus Christ,

4
00:00:07.460 --> 00:00:09.800
recognizing the vows that
you have made before God

5
00:00:09.800 --> 00:00:12.900
and these witnesses,
I pronounce that you're husband

6
00:00:13.260 --> 00:00:15.900
and wife. Clayton,
you may kiss your bride.
